  documentId: DOC_DAY2_NEWS
  documentType: 0
  title: "Deniz kirlili\u011Fi ve caretta carettalar i\xE7in uyar\u0131"
  body: "Antalya k\u0131y\u0131lar\u0131nda deniz kirlili\u011Fi alarm\u0131: baz\u0131
    bal\u0131k numunelerinde mikroplastik ve kimyasal kal\u0131nt\u0131 \u015F\xFCphesi
    ara\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131l\u0131yor. Kirlilik yaln\u0131zca sofray\u0131 de\u011Fil,
    caretta carettalar\u0131n ya\u015Fam alanlar\u0131n\u0131 da etkiliyor.\n\nBir
    bal\u0131\u011F\u0131n d\u0131\u015F g\xF6r\xFCn\xFC\u015F\xFC, temiz oldu\u011Funu
    kan\u0131tlamaz. Laboratuvar raporunu kontrol edin; yeni kaynak yasaklar\u0131
    i\xE7in Bakanl\u0131k faks\u0131n\u0131 takip edin.\n\nCOP31 haz\u0131rl\u0131k
    g\xFCnleri / Kurmaca yerel haber"
  taskInstructionBox: "Bal\u0131klar\u0131n kaynak ve habitat etiketlerini incele.
    Kirlilik etiket \xFCzerinden anla\u015F\u0131lamaz; analiz raporunu kontrol et."
  illustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 405376edd9ef06d4fb31f7b5baa4e567, type: 3}
